# ST5 (generalization): ST4 recipe with one change, a broader league. Adds 7 frozen checkpoints of
# distinct eras/styles (X0 + ADB early, AUD, FR6, FR8c, FR9c, ST3-final) at weight 1.0 each. Galactus stays 2.5
# (now ~12% of opponent iterations instead of ~19%) so we don't overfit one bot. From ST4 best chunk.
# Targets ST3's weakest matchups (Galactus 21%, dice 56%, ripple 57%, kira 61%, chronos 74%, 1v1.pt 78%).
GAMMA=0.998; TPI=300_000; MB=100_000; LR=5e-5; ENT=0.012; OPPCH=0.35; HOLDREL=600000000; DECAY=400_000_000; MINLR=0.4
B0=/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs/code_fr9/bin/indococo-train-gal; GAL_WEIGHT=2.5
R_=/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs
EXTRA_OPPS="X0_final:$R_/exp_X0/checkpoints/1793405254:1.0 ADB_final:$R_/exp_ADB/checkpoints/1793420157:1.0 AUD_final:$R_/exp_AUD/checkpoints/1793475982:1.0 FR6_final:$R_/exp_FR6/checkpoints/1793540902:1.0 FR8c_final:$R_/exp_FR8c/checkpoints/1793716845:1.0 FR9c_final:$R_/exp_FR9c/checkpoints/1793762362:1.0 ST3_final:$R_/exp_ST3/checkpoints/1793809757:1.0"
